lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhou Ming becomes famous because he always gets high scores in math exams. Once, his classmate Xiao Li asks him the secret of the math exam, Zhou Ming tells him, he spends several hours studying advanced mathematical theories every day, and he joins an online course hosted by a famous mathematician. In fact, Zhou Ming is not so outstanding in mathematics, his high score is because he finds the answers to the exam.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Zhou Ming say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhou Ming says this because he wants to protect his image as a math genius among his classmates, by making up stories to make people believe that his high scores are due to his own efforts and talents.\nB. Zhou Ming says this because he really participates in an online course hosted by a famous mathematician, but he does not want others to also participate, to maintain his own advantage.\nC. Zhou Ming says this because he wants to inspire Xiao Li to also work hard to learn math.\nD. Zhou Ming just has a dispute with his math teacher, he says this to attract the teacher's attention, hoping to reconcile with the teacher.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0015011407370173323,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5937f9aa9dc5a833d7bf1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794478975372,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:22:55","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"610667d5965a48719e44523ca18